Skill: Schema

Purpose:
  Defines schema for skill entities.

Required:
  @skill <id>
  domain <domain>
  level <L0-L5>
  version <version>
  status <DRAFT|EXPERIMENTAL|STABLE|DEPRECATED|RETIRED>

Optional:
  use <use-case>
  apply:
    - <application>
  requires:
    - <requirement>
  avoid:
    - <anti-pattern>
  maturity <UNKNOWN|EMERGING|VALIDATED|MATURE|STANDARD>
  risk <LOW|MEDIUM|HIGH>
  review <date>
  evidenceLevel <LOW|MEDIUM|HIGH>
  searchKeys:
    - <key>
  humanDoc <path>
  evidence:
    - <source>

Example:
  @skill SKILL-IDEMPOTENCY
  domain backend
  level L2
  version 1.3
  status STABLE
  use duplicate-safe operations
  apply:
    - payment
    - order
    - webhook
  requires:
    - stable-key
    - atomic-state
  maturity MATURE
  risk LOW
  review 2026-08
  evidenceLevel HIGH

State: +
  
